        "level": null,
        "markdown": "Jab bhi aap kisi aisi frame of reference se problems solve karte hain jo khud accelerate kar rahi ho (non-inertial frame), toh Newton ke laws directly apply nahi hote. Is problem ko fix karne ke liye hume ek fictitious force lagana padta hai jise **Pseudo Force** kehte hain.",
